[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is marked known: one issue, one fix queued. The desk's own view of it
shows more than one problem. The queued parser fix closes only the first one.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. Each problem below has its own ticket with the reports it covers.
